- BE/FE Trip interface mismatch: backend models.Trip emits {start_ts,end_ts,total_distance_mi,total_energy_kwh,total_duration_min,description}; frontend api/types.ts Trip declares {start_date,end_date,total_distance_km,total_cost,drive_count,charge_count}. Trusted FE contract per locked-policy (Phase-43/0023+0024+0025); reconciliation deferred to a separate prompt that can touch both internal/models/trip.go AND web/src/api/types.ts.
